      "title": "Wash sale",
      "html": "<p>Stock basis $30,000; loss-sale proceeds $22,000; qualifying substantially identical replacement cost $25,000. The full loss is disallowed and added to replacement basis.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "tcp-m4-tbs3-ex2",
      "title": "Other dispositions",
      "html": "<p>A Section 1231 schedule shows $90,000 net gain, of which $35,000 receives ordinary treatment under the supplied lookback analysis. A qualifying residence sale has $320,000 gain and an applicable $250,000 exclusion.</p>"
    }
