  "explanation": "<h3>Disallowed stock loss</h3><p>$30,000 − $22,000 = $8,000.</p><h3>Replacement stock basis</h3><p>$25,000 replacement cost + $8,000 disallowed loss.</p><h3>Section 1231 gain remaining for the stated capital treatment</h3><p>$90,000 − $35,000 = $55,000.</p><h3>Recognized residence gain after the supplied exclusion</h3><p>$320,000 − $250,000 = $70,000.</p>"
